{"s":67,"v":[{"t":"Blessed is He in whose hand is dominion, and He is over all things competent -","w":[["تَبَـٰرَكَ","Blessed is","tabāraka",""],["ٱلَّذِى","He","alladhī",""],["بِيَدِهِ","in Whose Hand","biyadihi","",[["بِ",10],["يَدِ",116],["هِ",5]]],["ٱلْمُلْكُ","(is) the Dominion","l-mul'ku","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُلْكُ",259]]],["وَهُوَ","and He","wahuwa","",[["وَ",1],["هُوَ",5]]],["عَلَىٰ","(is) over","ʿalā",""],["كُلِّ","every","kulli",""],["شَىْءٍۢ","thing","shayin",""],["قَدِيرٌ","All-Powerful","qadīrun",""]]},{"t":"[He] who created death and life to test you [as to] which of you is best in deed - and He is the Exalted in Might, the Forgiving -","w":[["ٱلَّذِى","The One Who","alladhī",""],["خَلَقَ","created","khalaqa",""],["ٱلْمَوْتَ","death","l-mawta","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَوْتَ",246]]],["وَٱلْحَيَوٰةَ","and life","wal-ḥayata","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["حَيَوٰةَ",163]]],["لِيَبْلُوَكُمْ","that He may test you","liyabluwakum","",[["لِ",8],["يَبْلُوَ",504],["كُمْ",4]]],["أَيُّكُمْ","which of you","ayyukum","",[["أَيُّ",71],["كُمْ",4]]],["أَحْسَنُ","(is) best","aḥsanu",""],["عَمَلًۭا","(in) deed","ʿamalan","ۚ"],["وَهُوَ","And He","wahuwa","",[["وَ",1],["هُوَ",5]]],["ٱلْعَزِيزُ","(is) the All-Mighty","l-ʿazīzu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَزِيزُ",130]]],["ٱلْغَفُورُ","the Oft-Forgiving","l-ghafūru","",[["ٱلْ",2],["غَفُورُ",138]]]]},{"t":"[And] who created seven heavens in layers. You do not see in the creation of the Most Merciful any inconsistency. So return [your] vision [to the sky]; do you see any breaks?","w":[["ٱلَّذِى","The One Who","alladhī",""],["خَلَقَ","created","khalaqa",""],["سَبْعَ","seven","sabʿa",""],["سَمَـٰوَٰتٍۢ","heavens","samāwātin",""],["طِبَاقًۭا","one above another","ṭibāqan","ۖ"],["مَّا","Not","mā",""],["تَرَىٰ","you see","tarā",""],["فِى","in","fī",""],["خَلْقِ","(the) creation","khalqi",""],["ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","(of) the Most Gracious","l-raḥmāni","",[["ٱل",2],["رَّحْمَـٰنِ",216]]],["مِن","any","min",""],["تَفَـٰوُتٍۢ","fault","tafāwutin","ۖ"],["فَٱرْجِعِ","So r